# What must never end up in a published tarball.  `files` in package.json
# whitelists the plugin and the bridge source; the entries below are generated
# locally, so packing from a working checkout would drag the virtualenv, the
# model package and the caches along.
#
# Measured 2026-10-03: npm cannot run in this environment ("Exit handler never
# called!"), and pnpm 12.6.0 ignores this file — `pnpm pack` with `files`
# listing `bridge/` produced 753,788,062 bytes including `bridge/.venv`
# (6,654 entries), `__pycache__` (784) and `bridge/core/models`.  Both
# documented install paths are unaffected: a local install records
# `link:<checkout>` (nothing is copied) and a git install takes tracked files
# only.  Keep this file as the guard for npm-style packing and publishing.
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/core/models/
.pytest_cache/
node_modules/
pnpm-lock.yaml
bridge/config.py.rendered
**/device.json
**/devices.json
*.token
token.txt
credentials.json
